{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09672","headline":"天山雪歌送萧治归京 · 岑参","name":"天山雪歌送萧治归京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天山有雪常不开，千峰万岭雪崔嵬。\n北风夜卷赤亭口，一夜天山雪更厚。\n能兼汉月照银山，复逐胡风过铁关。\n交河城边飞鸟绝，轮台路上马蹄滑。\n晻霭寒氛万里凝，阑干阴崖千丈冰。\n将军狐裘卧不暖，都护宝刀冻欲断。\n正是天山雪下时，送君走马归京师。\n雪中何以赠君别，惟有青青松树枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}